{{Short description|Football tournament group stage}}
{{Use dmy dates|date=June 2018}}
Play in '''Group E of the [[1990 FIFA World Cup]]''' completed on 21 June 1990. [[Spain national football team|Spain]] won the group, and advanced to the second round, along with [[Belgium national football team|Belgium]] and [[Uruguay national football team|Uruguay]]. [[South Korea national football team|South Korea]] failed to advance.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.rsssf.org/tables/90full.html |title=World Cup 1990 |publisher=[[RSSSF]] |access-date=30 April 2026}}</ref>

